1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Sign in to SCM ERP using your assigned login.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:18,000
From the left menu, select Indents.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:30,000
The Indent dashboard shows requests, status and work queues.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Select New Indent to start a material request.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Choose a BOM or add items, then enter quantity, required date and priority.
